# Golden-master recordings (plan 23-20, D-12, AC-26): keep LF in every checkout.
# core.autocrlf=true on the operator machine, and the repo-wide .gitattributes pins only
# .planning/intel, so without this a Windows checkout would write CRLF copies. compareRecording
# compares raw bytes, so a CRLF checkout would fail every scenario on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf
